#: ../../staff-guide.rst:2
msgid "About the staff guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:4
msgid ""
"The staff guide is a second, smaller guide that lives next to this one, "
"at ``/staff-guide/``. It is for people with a staff account, and it "
"covers what the staff accounts are and what sets them apart."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:9
msgid "Who can open it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:11
msgid ""
"Only staff accounts can. What happens to everyone else depends on who "
"they are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:13
msgid "Someone who has not signed in is asked to sign in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:14
msgid ""
"Someone signed in with a regular account is shown the site's forbidden "
"page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:16
msgid "Someone signed in with a staff account or the superuser account reads it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:19
msgid ""
"The sidebar follows the same rule. The staff guide's entry appears only "
"while you are signed in as staff, so a regular account never sees a link "
"it cannot use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:24
msgid ""
"Not seeing the entry is not a fault. If you expect to see it, check which"
" account you signed in with: :doc:`reference/accounts` lists what each "
"one can open."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:29
msgid "Trying it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:31
msgid ""
"Sign in with ``staff.user@example.com`` and the password ``password``. "
"See :doc:`first-visit/signing-in` if you need the steps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:33
msgid ""
"Choose *Staff guide* in the sidebar, or open the `staff guide </staff-"
"guide/>`_ directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:35
msgid ""
"Sign out and sign in as ``regular.user@example.com``, then open the "
"address again to see the forbidden page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:40
msgid ""
"The demo's accounts share one password, and anyone who can reach the site"
" can sign in as staff. Run it only where you would trust everyone who can"
" open it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../staff-guide.rst:45
msgid "The staff guide's entry in the sidebar, shown to staff accounts only."
msgstr ""
